    "body": "Problem:\nNvim shows `(libuv) kqueue(): Too many open files` on macos.\nref https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/40238\n\nSolution:\nAdd a healthcheck for this situation.\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-01T11:45:48Z",
    "comment_data": [],
    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "If the fds are exhausted and `/dev/fd/` itself cannot be scanned [here](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/4ab7dbdfdbfb778e0be2b7279541255fe026100a/runtime/lua/vim/fs.lua#L211-L217), I surmise that the healthcheck will show \"currently open: 0\", when in fact many are open.",
